WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.160
Returning to your residence

00:02.240 --> 00:03.920
You immediately gather your trusted followers

00:04.000 --> 00:05.667
To secretly plan an uprising

00:06.560 --> 00:08.893
But we only have two hundred men

00:10.040 --> 00:11.707
Two hundred is two hundred

00:12.800 --> 00:13.480
Two hundred men

00:13.560 --> 00:14.960
Strike first

00:16.720 --> 00:18.120
Your Highness

00:18.800 --> 00:20.200
Let's do it

00:31.160 --> 00:32.560
Rise up
